{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "go_park_00_01",
      "hash": "7fbbaaedc1e6df95",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "欢迎来到GO Park！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "go_park_00_02",
      "hash": "7fbba7edc1e6da7c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "想知道哪方面的说明？"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "go_park_00_03",
      "hash": "7fbba8edc1e6dc2f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你想做什么？"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "go_park_00_10",
      "hash": "7fbf2fedc1e9f76b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "带宝可梦来"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "go_park_00_11",
      "hash": "7fbf2eedc1e9f5b8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "GO Park"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "go_park_00_12",
      "hash": "7fbf31edc1e9fad1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "游乐区"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "go_park_00_13",
      "hash": "7fbf30edc1e9f91e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "查看说明"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "go_park_00_14",
      "hash": "7fbf33edc1e9fe37",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "退出"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "go_park_00_15",
      "hash": "7fbf32edc1e9fc84",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "关于带宝可梦来"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "go_park_00_16",
      "hash": "7fbf35edc1ea019d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "关于GO Park"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "go_park_00_17",
      "hash": "7fbf34edc1e9ffea",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "关于游乐区"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "go_park_00_20",
      "hash": "7fb51dedc1e18450",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你能将Pokémon GO里的\\n宝可梦带往GO Park。\\c\\n首先在Ｘ菜单的“设置”里\\n选择“与Pokémon GO连接”，\\r\\n与Pokémon GO进行匹配。\\c\\n接下来在Pokémon GO中\\n选择要发送的宝可梦。\\c\\n被带走的宝可梦将无法\\n返回Pokémon GO，\\r\\n敬请注意。"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "go_park_00_21",
      "hash": "7fb51eedc1e18603",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "从Pokémon GO那里\\n带来的宝可梦们\\r\\n会在GO Park里玩耍。\\c\\n如果和宝可梦交谈，\\n就能捕捉它们，\\r\\n或者将它们移动到\\r\\n别的GO Park。\\c\\n被捉住的宝可梦\\n无法返回GO Park。\\c\\n如果想离开GO Park，\\n请按X键。"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "go_park_00_22",
      "hash": "7fb51fedc1e187b6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "如果GO Park里有25只\\n相同种类的宝可梦，\\r\\n就能去游乐区玩耍了。\\c\\n带领宝可梦们\\n抵达上面的终点吧！\\c\\n在限制时间内带领全部\\n宝可梦抵达终点就算过关！\\c\\n小心地上出现的\\n干扰宝可梦！\\c\\n如果想中途退出游戏，\\n请按X键。"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "go_park_01_01",
      "hash": "d5055ee3b2da9820",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "GO Park 1"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "go_park_01_02",
      "hash": "d50561e3b2da9d39",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "GO Park 2"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "go_park_01_03",
      "hash": "d50560e3b2da9b86",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "GO Park 3"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "go_park_01_04",
      "hash": "d50563e3b2daa09f",
