      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR NUM3(0000)].[VAR NUM2(0001)]kg"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "id": "go_park_60_08",
      "hash": "248421f567545608",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "训练家　[VAR PGOTRAINER(0000)]"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "id": "go_park_60_09",
      "hash": "248422f5675457bb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR NUM4(0000,0000)]/[VAR NUM2(0001)]/[VAR NUM2(0002)]"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "id": "go_park_60_10",
      "hash": "24879ff5675761f9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "捕捉"
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "id": "go_park_60_11",
      "hash": "24879ef567576046",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "移动"
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "id": "go_park_70_01",
      "hash": "b46a7ac07b9d68a0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR NUM2(0000)]:[VAR NUM2(0001)].[VAR NUM2(0002)]"
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "id": "go_park_80_01",
      "hash": "82fa3762ec0872bd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "如果捕捉GO Park里的宝可梦，\\n宝可梦的信息将会与\\n原先Pokémon GO里的信息不同，\\n确定要继续吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "id": "go_park_90_01",
      "hash": "950ad72a53682d1a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR NUM3(0000)]"
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "id": "go_park_100_01",
      "hash": "3b2093cb115b62e2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "引导宝可梦前往终点！\\nＸ：菜单　Ｙ：缩放"
    }
